@title 3D Heat: the status line sits on its own row, and the Cooling advice window shows its notes once
@area 3D
@sizes 1280x688 1366x768 1920x1080
# After a Quick run of the hot cabinet the Heat panel buttons wrap, and the status line "Coarse 3D, not validated" must start its own row instead of splitting beside Keep as A. Cooling advice then lists its notes inside a scroll area with a visible scroll bar, and the model-estimate note is said once (the footer).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait 10
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 45
shot heat-panel-after-run
check_layout
click_text "Cooling advice"
wait_s 90
expect "Cooling advice"
expect "Tightest margin"
shot advice-top
scroll 600 400 -400
wait 10
shot advice-bottom
check_layout
